{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もお稽古でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/16/2178913/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥じらいを捨てる。\nすごい気持ちが良い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、ちょっとリンパを\nやられてしまいました。\n口の中が腫れてしまったの。\nご飯が上手く食べられないーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあーもー私アホだー\nどうして今なんだー\nとっとと治さないと...泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、アーモンド食べすぎて\nしまったのでお腹壊さないか心配だ。\nアーモンドは美味しいんだ。\nナッツは美味しいんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n昨日は朝からお仕事があって\n終わったあと、稽古まで時間が\nあったので、あみとデート。\n楽しかったねーあみちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/16/2178913/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこにこ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/16/2178913/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エスカレーター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのニット帽借りた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/16/2178913/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ被っただけでイケイケだね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/16/2178913/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/16/2178913/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白い服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/16/2178913/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張ろう。\nおやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}